<title>USA: St Joseph hogs steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Joseph hogs steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST. JOSEPH 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were steady. Top $54.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3	230-270 lbs    54.00-54.50</p>
<p>Sows:  Under 500 lbs 0.50-1.00 higher, over 500 lbs no test. Top 45.00.</p>
<p>US 1-2	300-500 lbs    44.50-45.00</p>
</text>
